              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Guerrillas have improvised weapon and javelins. They may exchange these for sling (free) or composite bow (+1) and may have buckler (free). Skirmishers. They may upgrade to I3 Ld 6 (+2). There must be more foot of the rising and guerrilla figures than there are Peltast figures.</characteristic>
